WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:06.462
It was late at night. A prison bus waited outside Metro City Prison.

2
00:00:06.463 --> 00:00:11.652
A guard came out of the prison and looked around.

3
00:00:11.653 --> 00:00:16.082
